{"3919840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sepan and the Seven Flasks", "steam_appid": 3919840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your ally, the <strong>Holy Flask</strong>, guide <strong>Sepan</strong> to the lost <strong>Seven Flasks of Power</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do the inhabitants of this world seem unable to see reality? What is that scream far away ? Will you find your way through the darkness? Will you survive this unpredictable world?<br>Dive into <strong>Sepan and the Seven Flasks</strong>, overcome obstacles, and gather all the <strong>Seven Flasks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Holy Flask</strong> watches over you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode with three difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several mini-games integrated into Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unlockable mini-games: runner, reflex, rhythm, and QTE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and global leaderboards for mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Optional] </strong>Twitch integration: allows viewers to interact with certain mini-games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable Mini-Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scooter Run (runner)</strong>: three difficulty levels, endless mode, Twitch chat integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dance (rhythm)</strong>: three dance styles, non-stop mode, Twitch chat integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reflex vs. a dog (QTE)</strong>: three difficulty levels, non-stop mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Jumps (timing)</strong>: three difficulty levels, non-stop mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mixing complexity, mystery, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous references to internet culture and video games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden characters to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Stalker lurking in the shadows, to avoid at all costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to thank the Holy Flask for its exceptional contribution.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your ally, the <strong>Holy Flask</strong>, guide <strong>Sepan</strong> to the lost <strong>Seven Flasks of Power</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do the inhabitants of this world seem unable to see reality? What is that scream far away ? Will you find your way through the darkness? Will you survive this unpredictable world?<br>Dive into <strong>Sepan and the Seven Flasks</strong>, overcome obstacles, and gather all the <strong>Seven Flasks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Holy Flask</strong> watches over you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode with three difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several mini-games integrated into Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unlockable mini-games: runner, reflex, rhythm, and QTE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and global leaderboards for mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Optional] </strong>Twitch integration: allows viewers to interact with certain mini-games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable Mini-Games</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scooter Run (runner)</strong>: three difficulty levels, endless mode, Twitch chat integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dance (rhythm)</strong>: three dance styles, non-stop mode, Twitch chat integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reflex vs. a dog (QTE)</strong>: three difficulty levels, non-stop mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Jumps (timing)</strong>: three difficulty levels, non-stop mode</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mixing complexity, mystery, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous references to internet culture and video games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden characters to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Stalker lurking in the shadows, to avoid at all costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to thank the Holy Flask for its exceptional contribution.</p>", "short_description": "Dive into an adventure and exploration game where each mini-game is a challenge to overcome as you progress in your quest: to gather the Seven Flasks of Power.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Italian, German, Portuguese - Portugal, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919840/c9586030b34e027a24710f6799b300b4e0af10cb/header.jpg?t=1766168167", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919840/06e39a2a86d19cdb417924dc9cb27fd07eb42cd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766168167", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919840/06e39a2a86d19cdb417924dc9cb27fd07eb42cd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766168167", "website": "https://sepan.picmid.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD FX-4100, Snapdragon X Elite<br></li><li><stro